"acobladors Animació i Flux de treball."

#: ../../user_manual/animation.rst:34
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Flux de treball"

#: ../../user_manual/animation.rst:36
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In traditional animation workflow, what you do is that you make *key "
#| "frames*, which contain the important poses, and then draw frames in "
#| "between (\\ *tweening* in highly sophisticated animator's jargon)."
msgid ""
"In traditional animation workflow, what you do is that you make :term:"
